678ebfc09b79a2e2fa0fe3d3f83b","author":{"name":"Ward Vandewege","email":"ward@jhvc.com","date":"2021-05-12T12:45:41Z"},"committer":{"name":"Ward Vandewege","email":"ward@jhvc.com","date":"2021-05-12T13:06:46Z"},"tree":{"sha":"614bcb5a0387ef87297f4c2e70cd8a30a212eb78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/614bcb5a0387ef87297f4c2e70cd8a30a212eb78"},"message":"Fix build breakage due to https://github.com/golang/go/issues/44129.\n\nThe issue was that our build pipeline uses 'go get' call to install\ngolint, which changed the go.mod/go.sum files (not good, but I hadn't\nnoticed before). Due to Golang bug #44129, this caused breakage on the\ndependencies of certain modules we use.\n\nThe fix was to switch to 'go install golang.org/x/lint/golint@latest'.\nThe addition of '@latest' puts 'go install' in module aware mode, which\nno longer changes go.mod file in the current directory. This is better,\nand it also avoids bug #44129.\n\nThis commit also has a change due to `go mod tidy`. Finally, I had to\nadd a longer timeout for the golangci-lint installation step in the\ngithub actions workflow, since that seems to take a bit over a minute\nnow.  This step is usually cached on subsequent runs, so we hadn't seen\nthat failure before.","parents":[{"sha":"d2748f34aaf4a189518dc2e5afce67ad55862791","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/d2748f34aaf4a189518dc2e5afce67ad55862791","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/d2748f34aaf4a189518dc2e5afce67ad55862791"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":4736201490,"node_id":"MDIzOkhlYWRSZWZGb3JjZVB1c2hlZEV2ZW50NDczNjIwMTQ5MA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/4736201490","actor":{"login":"cure","id":149135,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0OTEzNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/149135?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://a